            "sid": "1TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuti wabayeezya banabunyina makani aya, noti be simulimo mubotu wa-Kristo Jesu, uulelwa mumajwi aabuzumino aalwiisyo lubotu olo ndocilide mane kusikila sunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
